# The working tree is CRLF: this is written and read on Windows, and the .bat
# files want it. LF in the index, so a tool that saves a file the other way
# round is not a rewrite of every line in it -- which is how one edit came out
# as 3106 deleted lines once.
* text=auto eol=crlf

# Sheets, scans and audio are gitignored, but if one is ever committed on
# purpose, nothing is to touch a byte of it.
*.png -text
*.wav -text
*.tif -text
*.zip -text
*.pdf -text
